WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.064
Everyone was at the grocery store.

2
00:00:09.065 --> 00:00:12.466
Dad pushed the shopping cart.

3
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:18.255
Mom read the shopping list.

4
00:00:18.256 --> 00:00:25.490
"We need fruit," said Mom.

5
00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:29.588
Harry put apples into a bag.

6
00:00:29.589 --> 00:00:41.403
Emmy grabbed a bunch of bananas.

7
00:00:41.404 --> 00:00:46.167
"We also need vegetables," said Mom.

8
00:00:46.168 --> 00:00:56.205
"I don't like vegetables," said Oliver.

9
00:00:56.206 --> 00:01:04.889
Mom got broccoli and carrots.

10
00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:14.712
They went down another aisle.

11
00:01:14.713 --> 00:01:19.200
Harry put cookies into the cart.

12
00:01:19.201 --> 00:01:23.813
"Cookies are junk food," said Mom.

13
00:01:23.814 --> 00:01:35.498
Mom took the cookies out of the cart.

14
00:01:35.499 --> 00:01:41.477
Emmy put a bottle of soda into the cart.

15
00:01:41.478 --> 00:01:45.608
Mom put the soda back on the shelf.

16
00:01:45.609 --> 00:01:51.452
"We're not buying soda," said Mom.

17
00:01:51.453 --> 00:01:58.550
Oliver tried to sneak candy into the cart.

18
00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:01.028
Mom saw him do it.

19
00:02:01.029 --> 00:02:04.673
"No, Oliver," she said.

20
00:02:04.674 --> 00:02:10.863
"Candy is not good for you."

21
00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:14.348
Mom sighed and then looked at the kids.

22
00:02:14.349 --> 00:02:21.531
"Stop putting junk food in the cart," she said.

23
00:02:21.532 --> 00:02:25.783
Soon the shopping was done.

24
00:02:25.784 --> 00:02:29.850
Dad pushed the cart into the checkout.

25
00:02:29.851 --> 00:02:35.448
Everyone put the food on the counter.

26
00:02:35.449 --> 00:02:41.024
Mom found potato chips in the cart.

27
00:02:41.025 --> 00:02:43.699
She scowled.

28
00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:48.742
"Who put the chips in here?"

29
00:02:48.743 --> 00:02:52.125
"I didn't do it," said Harry.

30
00:02:52.126 --> 00:02:57.170
Emmy shrugged and looked at Oliver.

31
00:02:57.171 --> 00:03:01.858
"It wasn't me!" said Oliver.

32
00:03:01.859 --> 00:03:04.991
Mom looked at Dad.

33
00:03:04.992 --> 00:03:08.340
Dad smiled and shrugged.

34
00:03:08.341 --> 00:03:16.405
"I'll put them back," he said.

